{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56591","headline":"题宝相寺 · 南粤","name":"题宝相寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松径行才尽，香城绝世尘。\n倚岩开半殿，凿石见全身。\n钟鼓中天晓，烟花上界春。\n出门重稽首，愿值下生晨。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷九。\n《增广圣宋高僧诗选後集》卷中作南越《石佛寺》诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"南粤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}